Q3IcHCOkBKAs",null,null,null,[5],null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["這家拉麵店給人的第一印象加分，店面雖然不大，但整體環境乾淨整齊\n開放式廚房可以看到湯鍋現煮，熱氣不斷冒出，讓人一進門就很有食慾。用餐時段人潮不少要排隊一下，店員動作俐落、出餐速度穩定，不會等太久。\n拉麵湯頭濃郁卻不死鹹，入口滑順，搭配大塊炙燒的叉燒肉厚實軟嫩，油脂分布剛好，吃起來不膩。麵條口感彈性十足，和湯頭非常搭，配料簡單卻實在，附上整整一顆糖心蛋+少許筍乾有解膩的效果，整碗吃完非常有滿足感。整體來說是一家用心經營、品質穩定的好店，如果喜歡濃郁系拉麵，這家真的值得特地來吃一次。",null,[0,98]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4039805188032343976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzYjFJeFpIZFVhMng0VmpGbk5GcEVVWHBUTURsbVUwZDRjRlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4039805188032343976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzYjFJeFpIZFVhMng0VmpGbk5GcEVVWHBUTURsbVUwZDRjRlpWUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4039805188032343976/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzYjFJeFpIZFVhMng0VmpGbk5GcEVVWHBUTURsbVUwZDRjRlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4039805188032343976/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzYjFJeFpIZFVhMng0VmpGbk5GcEVVWHBUTURsbVUwZDRjRlpWUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/4039805188032343976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzYjFJeFpIZFVhMng0VmpGbk5GcEVVWHBUTURsbVUwZDRjRlpWUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/4039805188032343976/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFzYjFJeFpIZFVhMng0VmpGbk5GcEVVWHBUTURsbVUwZDRjRlpWUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,28621,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sb1IxZHdUa2x4VjFnNFpEUXpTMDlmU0d4cFZVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x82d734cb0f5bf2d0!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmloR1dwTklxV1g4ZDQzS09fSGxpVUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sb1IxZHdUa2x4VjFnNFpEUXpTMDlmU0d4cFZVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21sb1IxZHdUa2x4V